#: ../../source/reusify_README.md:5
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Reuse your objects and functions for maximum speed. This technique will "
"make any function run ~10% faster. You call your functions a lot, and it "
"adds up quickly in hot code paths."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reusify_README.md:21
msgid ""
"The above benchmark uses fibonacci to simulate a real high-cpu load. The "
"actual numbers might differ for your use case, but the difference should "
"not."
msgstr ""

